---
/*
 * Hero.
 *
 * Design constraint: the call to action has to be visible without scrolling,
 * even on the smallest viewport (320×568). That is why this block is compact
 * and scales in steps: paddings, heading size and button labels shrink below
 * 360px and 640px of width.
 */
---

<section class="border-b border-line bg-surface">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pt-8 pb-10 sm:px-6 sm:pt-14 sm:pb-16">
    <p
      class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.7rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-accent uppercase min-[360px]:text-xs"
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>
      <!-- [PLACEHOLDER: etiqueta de posicionamiento definitiva] -->
      Senior technical partner
    </p>

    <h1
      class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-2xl leading-[1.12] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink text-balance min-[360px]:mt-4 min-[360px]:text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
    >
      <!-- [PLACEHOLDER: titular definitivo] -->
      A senior technical partner who can embed as a developer, lead architecture
      decisions, or scale into a small team when the project needs it.
    </h1>

    <p
      class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[0.95rem] text-pretty text-muted min-[360px]:text-base sm:mt-4 sm:text-lg"
    >
      <!-- [PLACEHOLDER: two-line value proposition] -->
      Hands-on engineering and architecture for teams that need a senior
      perspective without committing to a permanent hire.
    </p>

    <div
      class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 min-[360px]:gap-3 sm:mt-7"
    >
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-accent px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-accent-ink sm:px-5 sm:py-3"
      >
        <span class="min-[360px]:hidden">Let's talk</span>
        <span class="hidden min-[360px]:inline">Start a conversation</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#services"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-line px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-paper sm:px-5 sm:py-3"
      >
        <span class="min-[360px]:hidden">Services</span>
        <span class="hidden min-[360px]:inline">See how I can help</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>